# This is an EXUDYN maintainer tool
#
# Details:  Generates src/Autogenerated/EnumTypes.h - the C++ enums shared with Python and their
#           string functions - from the registrator table in definitions/enumTypes.py
#           (revision plan step 33, part 2d). definitions/pybindEnums.py reads the same table
#           for the Python enums, the stubs and the documentation.
#
# Usage:    imported by tools/generators/pybindEmitter.py, which calls EmitHeader()
#
# Author:   Johannes Gerstmayr
